This PR https://github.com/go-kratos/kratos/pull/3509 modification has damaged my project. In my project, multiple Services will be registered within one process, and these Services have the same ID, but only the Service Names are different. For example:

```
namespace/demo.Greeter1/dae5d801-0d7c-4533-a5d8-010d7c05334a
namespace/demo.Greeter2/dae5d801-0d7c-4533-a5d8-010d7c05334a
```
Because I have adjusted the kratos.App, enabling a single App to register multiple Service instances.

